OL,3,ANew Zealand tricks and annual leave -
OL,4,Athe lengths fans are going to for GTA 6
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 13 years of waiting, some GTA 6
OL,7,Ffans are taking extra steps to play the
OL,8,Fgame - from booking time off work,
OL,9,Fbuying a console to play it on or even
OL,10,Fpretending they're halfway around the
OL,11,Fworld to get early access.
OL,13,FMarket intelligence firm Sensor Tower
OL,14,Festimates GTA 6 has already generated
OL,15,F$1.18bn (#894m) from 12 million
OL,16,Fpre-orders - although Rockstar has not
OL,17,Fconfirmed this.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
