OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANew Zealand tricks and annual leave -
OL,4,Athe lengths fans are going to for GTA 6
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite the option to preload the 212GB
OL,7,Fgame, Jennifer Holmes, chief executive
OL,8,Fof the London Internet Exchange, said
OL,9,Fseveral UK internet providers including
OL,10,FBT and Virgin Media had "increased
OL,11,Fcapacity in anticipation of higher
OL,12,Fdemand" ahead of launch.
OL,14,FBut for some fans, simply having the
OL,15,Fgame ready to play is not enough.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
